WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Forward heavy connects before the held FSE activation.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.850
Juri activates held Feng Shui Engine.

3
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.250
The medium and light chain leads toward crouching heavy.

4
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.850
Crouching heavy launches Ryu for the delayed air links.

5
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.850
Juri delays jumping light kick, then jumping light punch.

6
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.350
Raw Drive Rush catches the landing and reaches standing medium kick.

7
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.150
Back heavy kick chains into crouching heavy for another air chain.

8
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.650
Jumping light punch, medium punch and medium kick juggle Ryu.

9
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.850
Medium Shikusen and its medium-kick follow-up extend the carry.

10
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:11.500
Ryu lands far from the route’s midscreen starting position.
